	KikasaHudLead: {
		// DomainTitle: Open the Blood Lake
		// DomainBody: The hoard, drowning, and shades all need the Blood Lake open first.
		// DomainPrompt: Hold Kikasa and press {0}
		// SinkTitle: Sink Something
		// SinkBody: Hold an item and press the sink key to store it. Aim at a living thing and press the same key to push it under. A drowned boss leaves a shade you can seat later.
		// SinkPrompt: Once the water reaches your feet, press {0} while holding an item or aiming at an enemy
		// PanoramaTitle: Open the Lakeheart
		// PanoramaBody: This is Kikasa's main screen. The hound and ghost fire sit at the top, three seats in the middle, and the hoard at the bottom.
		// PanoramaPrompt: Click the wind chime at the bottom left, or hold Kikasa and press {0}
		// WheelTitle: Call the Shades
		// WheelBody: Seated shades come out on their own while the lake is open. The wheel calls them out or back at any time; fewer on the field means each one hits harder. The gold-flame sector on the same wheel lights or draws back the ghost fire.
		// WheelPrompt: Hold {0} to open the wheel, then release on a seat
		// WheelNoMemory: No shades yet. Drown a boss first, or skip this step.
		// RainTitle: Mutate into Ghost Rain
		// RainBody: The Flip the Lake key speaks twice — at full water, a tap flips the lake into ghost rain; a long hold pulls you into the dream. Foes slain under the rain rise as umbrella thralls that fight for you.
		// RainPrompt: At full water, tap {0} to flip the lake
		// RestartTitle: Rewind in the Rain
		// RestartBody: Ghost rain remembers. One press freezes the scene into a photograph, then the rain washes it open — everyone slides back to where they stood, wounds close, curses rinse off, and nothing can touch you while it rewinds.
		// RestartPrompt: In ghost rain at full water, press {0}
		// DreamTitle: Enter the Ghost Dream
		// DreamBody: Once the lake is full, hold Flip the Lake and the reflection pulls you under. Hold left click inside to call hounds; press the same key again to return.
